parts.text:
Red. Implement `processarAcontecimentos(agora)` (R9 lazy expiration + cascade convocation) and call it on the reads listed in R9: GET /atividades, GET /atividades/:id, GET /inscricoes, GET /inscricoes/:id. Also call at start of confirmarInscricao, cancelarInscricao, criarInscricao (so their checks see fresh state — e.g., JA_INSCRITO sees expirada not convocada; confirm sees expirada → EXPIRADA dispatch).

Loop:
```js
export function processarExpiracoes(agora) {
  for (;;) {
    const agoraMs = new Date(agora).getTime();
    const vencida = inscricoesStore.find(
      (i) => i.status === 'convocada' && agoraMs > prazoConvocacaoMs(i)
    );
    if (!vencida) break;
    vencida.status = 'expirada';
    vencida.convocadaEm = undefined;
    const atv = obterAtividadeBrutaPorId(vencida.atividadeId);
    if (atv) {
      sincronizarContadores(atv);
      // R7/R8: cascata convoca o próximo se a janela continua aberta
      convocarProximoDaFila(atv, agora);
    }
  }
}
```

Wait — potential infinite loop: convocarProximoDaFila convocates first of queue with convocadaEm=agora; prazo = min(agora+2h, encerr). If agora > encerramento → convocarProximo returns immediately (window check) → no new convocada → loop finds no vencida → break ✓. If agora < encerr: new convocada has prazo ≥ agora (agora+2h or encerr > agora? encerr > agora yes since window open; prazo > agora → not vencida (prazo must be > agora strictly... prazo = min(agora+2h, encerr) > agora ✓) → no vencida → break ✓.

Edge: convocarProximo loop convocates as many as slots allow — fine.

Also careful: vencida's convocadaEm cleared — expirada has convocadaAte null in format (status not convocada) ✓.

Multiple expired at once: loop handles one per iteration; convocar may convocate next with future prazo; other pre-existing convocadas with vencido prazo (could there be >1 convocada vencida? Only one convocada per activity at a time normally — but multiple activities: loop's find scans all ✓).

Where to hook in controllers:

inscricaoController:
- getInscricoes: processarExpiracoes(getAgora()) first
- getInscricaoPorId: same
- postInscricao (criar): service calls processar at start? criarInscricao has `agora` param — call processarExpiracoes(agora) at start of service function (before checks).
- cancelarInscricao: same at start — but careful: C21 scenario — cancel carla after encerramento: processar first (no convocadas) then cancel → trigger convocar (window closed) → no convocation ✓.
- confirmarInscricao: processar first → vencida becomes expirada → dispatch expirada → EXPIRADA ✓ (C38: processar converts diego convocada→expirada, cascade convocates... wait C38: no elisa — queue empty after diego? C38 scenario: carla confirmada cancelled, diego convocada, NO third person. Cascade: diego expires → convocarProximo: queue empty → nothing. Then confirm diego → status expirada → CONVOCACAO_EXPIRADA ✓.

Hmm wait — with processar first in confirm, C38's flow changes: status becomes expirada, dispatch `if (insc.status === 'expirada') → CONVOCACAO_EXPIRADA` ✓. And the direct prazo check becomes dead for confirm (still fine as belt for exact-boundary? If prazo vencido, processar already expired it — direct check unreachable. Keep both; harmless).

BUT C22's "sem nenhum outro acesso no meio": the GET itself processes — correct.

Edge — cancelarInscricao C21: also fine.

Edge — criarInscricao with expired-but-unprocessed convocada elsewhere: processar runs → proper JA_INSCRITO/queue state. Good.

Also GET /atividades and GET /atividades/:id (R9 lists them — occupancy counters change on cascade). Add to atividadeController. Let me check atividadeController quickly.

Also: should processar run in testeController PUT relogio? Not needed.

Another subtlety: convocarProximoDaFila is defined before prazoConvocacaoMs? prazoConvocacaoMs is function declaration — hoisted ✓. processarExpiracoes placement: after convocar helpers.

Also note convocarProximoDaFila window check uses `>= encerramentoMs` — at exactly encerramento no convocation ✓ (R8: encerramento is teto; at exactly encerr, prazo would be encerr = now → prazo not > now... anyway blocked).

Implement:
1. Add processarExpiracoes export in inscricaoService.
2. Call in service functions (criar, cancelar, confirmar) at start.
3. Call in controllers getInscricoes, getInscricaoPorId, atividadeController getAtividades, getAtividadePorId.

